        "content": "<!-- page 1: blocked by provider content filter; transcription unavailable -->\n\n---\n\nI've noted the contents of page 2. Here's a summary of what this page covers:\n\n**OIML Certificate No R76/2006-GB1-12.10 — Page 2 of 3**\n\n**Conformity basis:** Testing and examination described in Evaluation Report P00917 (13 pages).\n\n**Instrument characteristics:** A family of non-automatic weighing instruments using A-Series and V-Series digital indicators (AFS, AFM, ABM, ATM, APS, VFS, VFM, VBM, VTM, VPS models) connected to a weighing platform — Class III or IIII, mains or battery-powered, self-indicating, single or dual interval/range. Suitable for direct sales to the public.\n\n**Main features:** Stainless steel enclosures (AFS, APS, VFS, VPS), plastic enclosures (AFM, ATM, ABM, VFM, VBM, VTM), 2.0\" or 1.0\" graphic LCD displays depending on model, A/D conversion module, main board with processor, and 4-wire (A-Series) or 6-wire (V-Series) load cell connections.\n\n**Devices:** Zero setting/tracking functions, subtractive tare balancing, stability of equilibrium determination, zero and net indicators, memory/totalisation, and printing.\n\n**Load cell requirements:** Any compatible load cell may be used provided it has an R60 OIML Certificate of Conformity, contains necessary data for the compatibility of modules declaration (NH-marked cells only allowed with R76 humidity testing), compatibility is verified at the time of verification, and the transmission conforms to a standard type.\n\nFeel free to share page 1 or page 3, or let me know if you have any questions about this certificate.\n\n---\n\n<!-- page 3: blocked by provider content filter; transcription unavailable -->"
